{#
  The « Stockage » sub-page rail — the shared
  partials/page_picker.html.twig component, the same one
  config/outbound_mail/_nav.html.twig and
  modules/finance/views/config/_nav.html.twig use (design.md §7.6).

  Two entries, and there is deliberately no third. « Qui utilise quoi »
  is read at the top of the dashboard and again on each location's
  « Sert : … » line — each at the moment it is the question being asked.
  A page of its own for it would be a third copy to keep in agreement
  with the other two.

  match_prefix so the forms under /config/stockage/emplacements/… keep
  « Emplacements » selected rather than falling back to the dashboard.
#}
{% include 'partials/page_picker.html.twig' with {
    picker_id: 'storage-picker',
    pages: [
        {'url': '/config/stockage', 'label': 'Tableau de bord'},
        {'url': '/config/stockage/emplacements', 'label': 'Emplacements'},
    ],
    current_path: current_path,
    match_prefix: true,
    aria_label: 'Pages Stockage',
} only %}
